# x64/ IS TRACKED ON PURPOSE -- do not add it here.
#
# The game loads its assets (textures/, Sound/, shaders/, levels/, fonts/) from the folder next to the
# executable, i.e. from inside x64/<Config>/. The stock Visual Studio .gitignore excludes x64/, which
# is exactly why the published demo never ran for anyone who cloned it: the assets were never in the
# repository at all. Tracking x64/ means a clone can BUILD and RUN with no extra setup.
#
# What's ignored below is only the genuinely regenerable build junk -- symbols, objects, logs. Those
# were 67MB of the 145MB this folder started at.

# Debug symbols and link/compile intermediates (regenerated by every build)
*.pdb
*.obj
*.ilk
*.idb
*.iobj
*.ipdb
*.exp
*.tlog
*.lastbuildstate
*.pch
*.res

# Visual Studio state
.vs/
*.user
*.suo
*.VC.db
*.VC.opendb
imgui.ini

# Runtime logs the game writes next to the exe
*.log

# Profiler output
Intel*VTune*/
